{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S06、S13等段压缩了心理活动之间的因果关系，人物为什么从一种情绪转向另一种情绪，不如X交代得充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加粗重点让人能迅速抓住每段核心，话句短而有层次，感受又能随着音乐变化逐步出现，具体的音色、力度、旋律走向和身体感受也比X细腻。X的优势在于心理因果和前后递进交代得更完整，尤其人物反复克制、害怕失去、最终不再隐藏心意的过程更容易理解。综合屏幕阅读体验，我选Y，但它需要保留X那种把人物心理转折讲透的能力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "77509b99-e3b9-4773-aca8-53e4cde705c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T215552567286Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:56:37.972212+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6f6afd079c77667caede1df7704dfe41aad8aa2885df2e535a12065a5512738d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":